{"status":"success","meta":{"version":"v1","requestId":"ebb60fe5d6e0449a98cb04a25e86df68","generatedAt":"2026-05-31T21:04:30.542701Z"},"data":{"job":{"id":"dcdc374ca59d4221907bc8f633fc7932","jobType":"site_crawl","status":"queued","progress":0,"step":"Queued for extraction","errorMessage":null,"retryCount":0,"retryOfJobId":null,"startedAt":null,"finishedAt":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-31T21:03:37.250217Z","updatedAt":"2026-05-31T21:03:37.250217Z"},"extraction":{"id":"1994020dc3cc40058414b191db8d14e9","leadId":"e37e8c37ba664684b3c2221bb9c3e78b","jobId":"81db58e8b79a4751aaa94b00e67eb8b3","version":5,"crawlStatus":"partial","sitemapStatus":"error","pagesDiscovered":6,"pagesCrawled":6,"canonicalWebsiteUrl":"https://lenquant.com","detectedWebsiteUrl":null,"summary":{"companyName":"LenQuant","canonicalWebsiteUrl":"https://lenquant.com","detectedWebsiteUrl":null,"positioningSummary":"Homepage title: LenQuant | Applied Intelligence Lab Meta description: LenQuant builds focused products across growth and trading.","audienceClues":["Audience not explicit in public metadata; review manually."],"serviceClues":["Applied intelligence for change."],"ctaClues":["Contact"],"toneClues":[]},"pageInventory":[{"url":"https://lenquant.com","source":"homepage","status":"crawled","title":"LenQuant | Applied Intelligence Lab","meta":{"description":"LenQuant builds focused products across growth and trading.","viewport":"width=device-width, initial-scale=1","theme-color":"#0b1020","og:type":"website","og:site_name":"LenQuant","og:title":"LenQuant | Applied Intelligence Lab","og:description":"LenQuant builds focused products across growth and trading.","og:url":"https://lenquant.com/","og:image":"https://lenquant.com/og-image.png","og:image:width":"1200","og:image:height":"630","twitter:card":"summary_large_image","twitter:title":"LenQuant | Applied Intelligence Lab","twitter:description":"LenQuant builds focused products across growth and trading.","twitter:image":"https://lenquant.com/og-image.png","msapplication-config":"/favicon/browserconfig.xml","next-head-count":"25"},"summary":"Title: LenQuant | Applied Intelligence Lab | Description: LenQuant builds focused products across growth and trading. | H1: Applied intelligence for change.","cleanedText":"LenQuant\nApplied Intelligence Lab\nHome\nProducts\nLab\nAbout\nContact\nWork With LenQuant\nApplied intelligence for change.\n\nLenQuant builds focused products for several areas of work. The aim is simple: better tools, clearer judgment, and less friction in the work that matters.\n\nProduct company\nApplied AI lab\nSelective partner\nExplore Products\nWork With LenQuant\n\nPORTFOLIO\n\nFocused products that show the approach.\n\nTwo focused products, each built to make complex work clearer and easier to execute.\n\nGROWTH\nLengrowth\n\nGROWTH SYSTEMS\n\nSystems for acquisition, experimentation, and marketing execution.\n\nVisit LenGrowth\nTRADING\nLentrading\n\nTRADING INTELLIGENCE\n\nTrading tools for disciplined market decisions, analysis, and execution.\n\nVisit Trading\n\nHOW WE BUILD\n\nHow LenQuant thinks about product.\n\nWe build products where intelligence matters because it fits real work, real context, and real decisions.\n\n01\nWe build around decision-heavy work\n\nLenQuant focuses on environments where context matters, timing matters, and better tools can change outcomes.\n\n02\nWe launch products, not disconnected experiments\n\nThe portfolio spans growth and trading, and the shared standard is practical value.\n\n03\nWe partner selectively\n\nLenQuant is not an agency-for-hire. We work with a small number of founders, partners, and investors when the fit is clear.\n\nPRINCIPLES\n\nA shared way of building across the portfolio.\n\nThe products are not in one category. They belong together because they solve work in a similar way.\n\nContext over prompts\n\nWe build products that start from live operating context instead of making users restate everything from scratch.\n\nIntelligence inside workflows\n\nUseful intelligence belongs where decisions happen: inside research, execution, meetings, and operating loops.\n\nTools that improve with use\n\nThe best systems compound as they learn from behavior, history, conversations, and repeated use.\n\nDesign for real work\n\nWe care about speed, clarity, and judgment in environments where friction quietly slows good work.\n\nBuild focused, not bloated\n\nEach product should do a narrow job exceptionally well before it expands into adjacent territory.\n\nProducts with a clear point of view\n\nWe prefer tools that feel opinionated, legible, and sharp over generic software that tries to be everything at once.\n\nBUILD WITH US\n\nOpen to a small number of the right conversations.\n\nLenQuant builds its own products and occasionally partners on work that fits the same standard.\n\nAUDIENCE\nFor product visitors\n\nSee the portfolio quickly and head straight to the right product.\n\nFor investors\n\nUnderstand the company, the portfolio, and the long-term direction behind it.\n\nFor strategic partners\n\nExplore selective opportunities for collaboration on products and new ventures.\n\nFor talent\n\nGet a feel for the standard of work, product taste, and culture behind LenQuant.\n\nPartner With LenQuant\nInvestor Inquiries\n\nCOMPANY\n\nA product company with the range to build, partner, and launch selectively.\nLenQuant builds its own products and stays open to a small number of aligned collaborations.\nProduct-led, technically ambitious, and selective about where it works.\n\nCREDIBILITY\n\nA company built with long-term standards.\n\nThis site explains the company, but the clearest proof is still the work itself.\n\nOPEN EACH CHAPTER TO SEE HOW THE COMPANY THINKS\n\nBUILD\nFocused products over broad platforms\n\n- We build focused tools where product quality and clarity matter more than breadth.\nLenQuant looks for categories where software can sharpen judgment, reduce drag, and become part of the work itself. We would rather ship a clear product with a strong point of view than stretch into a vague platform story.\n\nOPERATE\nExecution is where products prove themselves\n\n- Products need to hold up in real workflows, repeated use, and everyday pressure.\nOur standard is simple: the product has to hold up when timing matters. That means fewer abstractions, better defaults, and tools that stay useful under pressure instead of only looking good in a concept deck.\n\nEXPAND\nMore products can grow from the same company view\n\n- The current portfolio is a foundation for future products and selective new initiatives.\nGrowth and trading are the early proof points. Over time, the company can extend the same standard into new products where context, speed, and execution quality matter.\n\nNEXT\n\nChoose where to go next.\n\nGo to a product, learn more about the company, or start a conversation.\n\nGo to LenGrowth\n\nTools for acquisition, experimentation, and growth execution.\n\nVisit LenGrowth\nGo to Trading\n\nDecision support and market context for disciplined trading execution.\n\nVisit Trading\nTalk to LenQuant\n\nFor partnerships, investor conversations, media, and talent outreach.\n\nContact LenQuant\n\nLENQUANT\n\nAn applied intelligence company building focused products and pursuing a small number of new ventures.\n\nProducts\nLengrowth\nLentrading\nCompany\nLab\nAbout\nContact\nBuild With Us\nPartnerships\nInvestors\nTalent\n(c) 2026 LenQuant. All rights reserved.\nhello@lenquant.com","depth":0,"ctaCount":3,"confidence":95,"citations":[{"pageUrl":"https://lenquant.com","evidenceType":"title","label":"Page title","excerpt":"LenQuant | Applied Intelligence Lab","confidence":86},{"pageUrl":"https://lenquant.com","evidenceType":"meta","label":"Meta description","excerpt":"LenQuant builds focused products across growth and trading.","confidence":80},{"pageUrl":"https://lenquant.com","evidenceType":"heading","label":"Primary heading","excerpt":"Applied intelligence for change.","confidence":76},{"pageUrl":"https://lenquant.com","evidenceType":"cta","label":"CTA text","excerpt":"Contact","confidence":78},{"pageUrl":"https://lenquant.com","evidenceType":"section","label":"Section 1","excerpt":"LenQuant Applied Intelligence Lab Open navigation menu Home Products Lab About Contact Work With LenQuant","confidence":63},{"pageUrl":"https://lenquant.com","evidenceType":"section","label":"Applied intelligence for change.","excerpt":"Applied intelligence for change. LenQuant builds focused products for several areas of work. The aim is simple: better tools, clearer judgment, and less friction in the work that matters. Product company Applied AI lab S","confidence":65},{"pageUrl":"https://lenquant.com","evidenceType":"section","label":"Lengrowth","excerpt":"Growth Lengrowth Growth Systems Systems for acquisition, experimentation, and marketing execution. Visit LenGrowth","confidence":57},{"pageUrl":"https://lenquant.com","evidenceType":"section","label":"Lentrading","excerpt":"Trading Lentrading Trading Intelligence Trading tools for disciplined market decisions, analysis, and execution. Visit Trading","confidence":58},{"pageUrl":"https://lenquant.com","evidenceType":"section","label":"Focused products that show the approach.","excerpt":"Portfolio Focused products that show the approach. Two focused products, each built to make complex work clearer and easier to execute.","confidence":58}],"errors":[],"rawHtml":"<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><meta charSet=\"utf-8\"/><title>LenQuant | Applied Intelligence Lab</title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"LenQuant builds focused products across growth and trading.\"/><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"/><meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#0b1020\"/><meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\"/><meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"LenQuant\"/><meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"LenQuant | Applied Intelligence Lab\"/><meta property=\"og:description\" c