"true\"></div></div><div class=\"section-header-copy\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Portfolio</p><h2>Focused products that show the approach.</h2><p class=\"section-description\">Two focused products, each built to make complex work clearer and easier to execute.</p></div></div><div class=\"product-spotlight-grid\"><article class=\"product-spotlight tone-emerald\"><span class=\"product-spotlight-icon\"><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 19h16M7 15l3-3 3 2 4-5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"></path><circle cx=\"7\" cy=\"15\" r=\"1.1\" fill=\"currentColor\"></circle><circle cx=\"10\" cy=\"12\" r=\"1.1\" fill=\"currentColor\"></circle><circle cx=\"13\" cy=\"14\" r=\"1.1\" fill=\"currentColor\"></circle><circle cx=\"17\" cy=\"9\" r=\"1.1\" fill=\"currentColor\"></circle></svg></span><div class=\"product-spotlight-copy\"><span class=\"badge\">Growth</span><h3>Lengrowth</h3><p class=\"product-spotlight-kicker\">Growth Systems</p><p>Systems for acquisition, experimentation, and marketing execution.</p></div><a class=\"button button-primary\" href=\"https://growth.lenquant.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" style=\"--coord-x:0;--coord-y:0\"><span class=\"button-inner\"><span class=\"button-label\">Visit LenGrowth</span><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M13 5l7 7-7 7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"></path></svg></span></a></article><article class=\"product-spotlight tone-amber\"><span class=\"product-spotlight-icon\"><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 12h4l2.2-5 3.6 10 2.5-5H21\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"></path></svg></span><div class=\"product-spotlight-copy\"><span class=\"badge\">Trading</span><h3>Lentrading</h3><p class=\"product-spotlight-kicker\">Trading Intelligence</p><p>Trading tools for disciplined market decisions, analysis, and execution.</p></div><a class=\"button button-primary\" href=\"https://trading.lenquant.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" style=\"--coord-x:0;--coord-y:0\"><span class=\"button-inner\"><span class=\"button-label\">Visit Trading</span><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M13 5l7 7-7 7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"></path></svg></span></a></article></div></div></section><section class=\"section\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"section-header section-header-with-lead\"><div class=\"section-header-lead\"><div class=\"section-accent-icon section-accent-icon-pie\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"section-header-copy\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">How We Build</p><h2>How LenQuant thinks about product.</h2><p class=\"section-description\">We build products where intelligence matters because it fits real work, real context, and real decisions.</p></div></div><div class=\"thesis-flow\"><article class=\"card flow-card tone-emerald\" style=\"--pointer-x:50%;--pointer-y:50%\"><span class=\"flow-index\">0<!-- -->1</span><div class=\"feature-card-top\"><h3>We build around decision-heavy work</h3><span class=\"card-icon subtle\"><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 12h4l2.2-5 3.6 10 2.5-5H21\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"></path></svg></span></div><p>LenQuant focuses on environments where context matters, timing matters, and better tools can change outcomes.</p></article><article class=\"card flow-card tone-amber\" style=\"--pointer-x:50%;--pointer-y:50%\"><span class=\"flow-index\">0<!-- -->2</span><div class=\"feature-card-top\"><h3>We launch products, not disconnected experiments</h3><span class=\"card-icon subtle\"><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 4l8 4-8 4-8-4 8-4zm-8 8l8 4 8-4M4 16l8 4 8-4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"></path></svg></span></div><p>The portfolio spans growth and trading, and the shared standard is practical value.</p></article><article class=\"card flow-card tone-rose\" style=\"--pointer-x:50%;--pointer-y:50%\"><span class=\"flow-index\">0<!-- -->3</span><div class=\"feature-card-top\"><h3>We partner selectively</h3><span class=\"card-icon subtle\"><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 6a2 2 0 1 0 0 4 2 2 0 0 0 0-4zm0 8a2 2 0 1 0 0 4 2 2 0 0 0 0-4zm10-4a2 2 0 1 0 0 4 2 2 0 0 0 0-4zM9 8h4a4 4 0 0 1 4 4m-8 4h4a4 4 0 0 0 4-4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"></path></svg></span></div><p>LenQuant is not an agency-for-hire. We work with a small number of founders, partners, and investors when the fit is clear.</p></article></div></div></section><section class=\"section\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"section-header section-header-with-lead\"><div class=\"section-header-lead\"><div class=\"section-accent-icon section-accent-icon-pulse\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"section-header-copy\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Principles</p><h2>A shared way of building across the portfolio.</h2><p class=\"section-description\">The products are not in one category. They belong together because they solve work in a similar way.</p></div></div><div class=\"grid-3\"><article class=\"card principle-card tone-emerald\" style=\"--pointer-x:50%;--pointer-y:50%\"><span class=\"card-icon principle-icon\"><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 4l8 4-8 4-8-4 8-4zm-8 8l8 4 8-4M4 16l8 4 8-4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"></path></svg></span><h3>Context over prompts</h3><p>We build products that start from live operating context instead of making users restate everything from scratch.</p></article><article class=\"card principle-card tone-amber\" style=\"--pointer-x:50%;--pointer-y:50%\"><span class=\"card-icon principle-icon\"><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 12h4l2.2-5 3.6 10 2.5-5H21\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"></path></svg></span><h3>Intelligence inside workflows</h3><p>Useful intelligence belongs where decisions happen: inside research, execution, meetings, and operating loops.</p></article><article class=\"card principle-card tone-rose\" style=\"--pointer-x:50%;--pointer-y:50%\"><span class=\"card-icon principle-icon\"><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M8 4H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v2m12-4h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v2M8 20H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-2m12 4h2a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-2M7 12h10\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"></path></svg></span><h3>Tools that improve with use</h3><p>The best systems compound as they learn from behavior, history, conversations, and repeated use.</p></article><article class=\"card principle-card tone-emerald\" style=\"--pointer-x:50%;--pointer-y:50%\"><span class=\"card-icon principle-icon\"><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 3l7 3v5c0 4.5-2.7 7.9-7 10-4.3-2.1-7-5.5-7-10V6l7-3z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"></path></svg></span><h3>Design for real work</h3><p>We care about speed, clarity, and judgment in environments where friction quietly slows good work.</p></article><article class=\"card principle-card tone-amber\" style=\"--pointer-x:50%;--pointer-y:50%\"><span class=\"card-icon principle-icon\"><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 6a2 2 0 1 0 0 4 2 2 0 0 0 0-4zm0 8a2 2 0 1 0 0 4 2 2 0 0 0 0-4zm10-4a2 2 0 1 0 0 4 2 2 0 0 0 0-4zM9 8h4a4 4 0 0 1 4 4m-8 4h4a4 4 0 0 0 4-4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"></path></svg></span><h3>Build focused, not bloated</h3><p>Each product should do a narrow job exceptionally well before it expands into adjacent territory.</p></article><article class=\"card principle-card tone-rose\" style=\"--pointer-x:50%;--pointer-y:50%\"><span class=\"card-icon principle-icon\"><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 3l1.7 5.3L19 10l-5.3 1.7L12 17l-1.7-5.3L5 10l5.3-1.7L12 3zm6 12l.8 2.2L21 18l-2.2.8L18 21l-.8-2.2L15 18l2.2-.8L18 15zM6 14l.8 2.2L9 17l-2.2.8L6 20l-.8-2.2L3 17l2.2-.8L6 14z\" fill=\"currentColor\"></path></svg></span><h3>Products with a clear point of view</h3><p>We prefer tools that feel opinionated, legible, and sharp over generic software that tries to be everything at once.</p></article></div></div></section><section class=\"section\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"section-header section-header-with-lead\"><div class=\"section-header-lead\"><div class=\"section-accent-icon section-accent-icon-balance\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"section-header-copy\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Build With Us</p><h2>Open to a small number of the right conversations.</h2><p class=\"section-description\">LenQuant builds its own products and occasionally partners on work that fits the same standard.</p></div></div><div class=\"partner-grid\"><article class=\"card cta-panel tone-emerald\" style=\"--pointer-x:50%;--pointer-y:50%\"><span class=\"badge\"><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M16.5 19a4.5 4.5 0 0 0-9 0M12 12a3 3 0 1 0 0-6 3 3 0 0 0 0 6zm6.5 7a3.5 3.5 0 0 0-3.2-3.5M17 11a2.5 2.5 0 1 0 0-5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"></path></svg>Audience</span><div class=\"grid-2 audience-grid\"><div class=\"audience-item\"><h3>For product visitors</h3><p>See the portfolio quickly and head straight to the right product.</p></div><div class=\"audience-item\"><h3>For investors</h3><p>Understand the company, the portfolio, and the long-term direction behind it.</p></div><div class=\"audience-item\"><h3>For strategic partners</h3><p>Explore selective opportunities for collaboration on products and new ventures.</p></div><div class=\"audience-item\"><h3>For talent</h3><p>Get a feel for the standard of work, product taste, and culture behind LenQuant.</p></div></div><div class=\"cta-row section-actions\"><a class=\"button button-primary\" style=\"--coord-x:0;--coord-y:0\" href=\"/contact\"><span class=\"button-inner\"><span class=\"button-label\">Partner With LenQuant</span><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M13 5l7 7-7 7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"></path></svg></span></a><a class=\"button button-secondary\" style=\"--coord-x:0;--coord-y:0\" href=\"mailto:hello@lenquant.com?subject=Investor%20Inquiry\"><span class=\"button-inner\"><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 7h16v10H4zM4 8l8 6 8-6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"></path></svg><span class=\"button-label\">Investor Inquiries</span></span></a></div></article><article class=\"card quote-card tone-rose\" style=\"--pointer-x:50%;--pointer-y:50%\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Company</p><h3>A product company with the range to build, partner, and launch selectively.</h3><blockquote>LenQuant builds its own products and stays open to a small number of aligned collaborations.</blockquote><footer>Product-led, technically ambitious, and selective about where it works.</footer></article></div></div></section><section class=\"section\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"section-header section-header-with-lead\"><div class=\"section-header-lead\"><div class=\"section-accent-icon section-accent-icon-cradle\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"section-header-copy\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Credibility</p><h2>A company built with long-term standards.</h2><p class=\"section-description\">This site explains the company, but the clearest proof is still the work itself.</p></div></div><div class=\"credibility-accordion\"><div class=\"credibility-tabs\"><p class=\"credibility-tabs-label\">Open each chapter to see how the company thinks</p><div class=\"timeline-trigger tone-emerald is-active\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"accordion-trigger is-active\" aria-expanded=\"true\"><span class=\"timeline-marker\">Build</span><div class=\"timeline-title\"><span class=\"card-icon subtle\"><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 4l8 4-8 4-8-4 8-4zm-8 8l8 4 8-4M4 16l8 4 8-4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"></path></svg></span><h3>Focused products over broad platforms</h3></div></button><div class=\"accordion-panel is-open\"><p><strong>- <!-- -->We build focused tools where product quality and clarity matter more than breadth.</strong><br/>LenQuant looks for categories where software can sharpen judgment, reduce drag, and become part of the work itself. We would rather ship a clear product with a strong point of view than stretch into a vague platform story.</p></div></div><div class=\"timeline-trigger tone-amber \"><button type=\"button\" class=\"accordion-trigger \" aria-expanded=\"false\"><span class=\"timeline-marker\">Operate</span><div class=\"timeline-title\"><span class=\"card-icon subtle\"><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 12h4l2.2-5 3.6 10 2.5-5H21\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"></path></svg></span><h3>Execution is where products prove themselves</h3></div></button><div class=\"accordion-panel \"><p><strong>- <!-- -->Products need to hold up in real workflows, repeated use, and everyday pressure.</strong><br/>Our standard is simple: the product has to hold up when timing matters. That means fewer abstractions, better defaults, and tools that stay useful under pressure instead of only looking good in a concept deck.</p></div></div><div class=\"timeline-trigger tone-rose \"><button type=\"button\" class=\"accordion-trigger \" aria-expanded=\"false\"><span class=\"timeline-marker\">Expand</span><div class=\"timeline-title\"><span class=\"card-icon subtle\"><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 6a2 2 0 1 0 0 4 2 2 0 0 0 0-4zm0 8a2 2 0 1 0 0 4 2 2 0 0 0 0-4zm10-4a2 2 0 1 0 0 4 2 2 0 0 0 0-4zM9 8h4a4 4 0 0 1 4 4m-8 4h4a4 4 0 0 0 4-4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"></path></svg></span><h3>More products can grow from the same company view</h3></div></button><div class=\"accordion-panel \"><p><strong>- <!-- -->The current portfolio is a foundation for future products and selective new initiatives.</strong><br/>Growth and trading are the early proof points. Over time, the company can extend the same standard into new products where context, speed, and execution quality matter.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"section-header section-header-with-lead\"><div class=\"section-header-lead\"><div class=\"section-accent-icon section-accent-icon-arrows\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"section-header-copy\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Next</p><h2>Choose where to go next.</h2><p class=\"section-description\">Go to a product, learn more about the company, or start a conversation.</p></div></div><div class=\"next-grid\"><div class=\"next-link tone-emerald\"><span class=\"product-spotlight-icon\"><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 19h16M7 15l3-3 3 2 4-5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"></path><circle cx=\"7\" cy=\"15\" r=\"1.1\" fill=\"currentColor\"></circle><circle cx=\"10\" cy=\"12\" r=\"1.1\" fill=\"currentColor\"></circle><circle cx=\"13\" cy=\"14\" r=\"1.1\" fill=\"currentColor\"></circle><circle cx=\"17\" cy=\"9\" r=\"1.1\" fill=\"currentColor\"></circle></svg></span><h3>Go to LenGrowth</h3><p>Tools for acquisition, experimentation, and growth execution.</p><a class=\"button button-primary\" href=\"https://growth.lenquant.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" style=\"--coord-x:0;--coord-y:0\"><span class=\"button-inner\"><span class=\"button-label\">Visit LenGrowth</span><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M13 5l7 7-7 7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"></path></svg></span></a></div><div class=\"next-link tone-amber\"><span class=\"product-spotlight-icon\"><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 12h4l2.2-5 3.6 10 2.5-5H21\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"></path></svg></span><h3>Go to Trading</h3><p>Decision support and market context for disciplined trading execution.</p><a class=\"button button-primary\" href=\"https://trading.lenquant.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" style=\"--coord-x:0;--coord-y:0\"><span class=\"button-inner\"><span class=\"button-label\">Visit Trading</span><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M13 5l7 7-7 7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"></path></svg></span></a></div><div class=\"next-link tone-emerald\"><span class=\"product-spotlight-icon\"><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 7h16v10H4zM4 8l8 6 8-6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"></path></svg></span><h3>Talk to LenQuant</h3><p>For partnerships, investor conversations, media, and talent outreach.</p><a class=\"button button-secondary\" style=\"--coord-x:0;--coord-y:0\" href=\"/contact\"><span class=\"button-inner\"><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 7h16v10H4zM4 8l8 6 8-6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"></path></svg><span class=\"button-label\">Contact LenQuant</span></span></a></div></div></div></section><div class=\"separator\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div></main><footer class=\"site-footer\"><div class=\"container site-footer-grid\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">LenQuant</p><p class=\"footer-blurb\">An applied intelligence company building focused products and pursuing a small number of new ventures.</p></div><div><h3>Products</h3><ul class=\"footer-list\"><li><a href=\"https://growth.lenquant.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Lengrowth</a></li><li><a href=\"https://trading.lenquant.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Lentrading</a></li></ul></div><div><h3>Company</h3><ul class=\"footer-list\"><li><a href=\"/lab\">Lab</a></li><li><a href=\"/about\">About</a></li><li><a href=\"/contact\">Contact</a></li></ul></div><div><h3>Build With Us</h3><ul class=\"footer-list\"><li><a href=\"mailto:hello@lenquant.com?subject=Partnership%20Inquiry\">Partnerships</a></li><li><a href=\"mailto:hello@lenquant.com?subject=Investor%20Inquiry\">Investors</a></li><li><a href=\"mailto:hello@lenquant.com?subject=Talent%20Inquiry\">Talent</a></li></ul></div></div><div class=\"container site-footer-bottom\"><span>(c) 2026 LenQuant. All rights reserved.</span><span class=\"footer-contact\"><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 7h16v10H4zM4 8l8 6 8-6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"></path></svg>hello@lenquant.com</span></div></footer></div></div><script id=\"__NEXT_DATA__\" type=\"application/json\">{\"props\":{\"pageProps\":{}},\"page\":\"/\",\"query\":{},\"buildId\":\"24DXxffZUpWRzhgE6YXpy\",\"nextExport\":true,\"autoExport\":true,\"isFallback\":false,\"scriptLoader\":[]}</script></body></html>","rawHtmlRef":"c6c7b23be582cf6d819336c466da6d967fc147b909aafad7965d8137e88c16c3","rawHtmlHash":"c6c7b23be582cf6d819336c466da6d967fc147b909aafad7965d8137e88c16c3","rawHtmlBytes":27727,"rawHtmlTruncated":false,"fonts":["\"Times New Roman\"","\"Plus Jakarta Sans\", sans-serif","\"PT Serif\", serif"],"colors":["rgba(18, 18, 24, 0.66)","rgb(244, 244, 245)","rgb(26, 26, 26)","rgb(247, 248, 248)","rgb(0, 0, 0)","rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06)","rgba(18, 18, 24, 0.78)","color(srgb 0.281365 0.789521 0.621138 / 0.771686)","rgba(8, 8, 11, 0.78)","rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.16)","rgb(250, 250, 250)","rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04)","rgb(180, 180, 189)","rgb(161, 161, 170)","rgb(168, 168, 168)","rgb(90, 88, 88)","rgba(244, 114, 182, 0.12)","rgba(18, 18, 24, 0.84)","color(srgb 0.969932 0.708336 0.266331 / 0.771686)","rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06)","rgb(212, 212, 216)","rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)","rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05)","rgba(24, 24, 30, 0.96)"],"headings":["Applied intelligence for change.","Focused products that show the approach.","Lengrowth","Lentrading","How LenQuant thinks about product.","We build around decision-heavy work","We launch products, not disconnected experiments","We partner selectively","A shared way of building across the portfolio.","Context over prompts","Intelligence inside workflows","Tools that improve with use","Design for real work","Build focused, not bloa