trading.","twitter:image":"https://lenquant.com/og-image.png","msapplication-config":"/favicon/browserconfig.xml","next-head-count":"25"},"summary":"Title: LenQuant | Applied Intelligence Lab | Description: LenQuant builds focused products across growth and trading. | H1: Applied intelligence for change.","cleanedText":"LenQuant\nApplied Intelligence Lab\nHome\nProducts\nLab\nAbout\nContact\nWork With LenQuant\nApplied intelligence for change.\n\nLenQuant builds focused products for several areas of work. The aim is simple: better tools, clearer judgment, and less friction in the work that matters.\n\nProduct company\nApplied AI lab\nSelective partner\nExplore Products\nWork With LenQuant\n\nPORTFOLIO\n\nFocused products that show the approach.\n\nTwo focused products, each built to make complex work clearer and easier to execute.\n\nGROWTH\nLengrowth\n\nGROWTH SYSTEMS\n\nSystems for acquisition, experimentation, and marketing execution.\n\nVisit LenGrowth\nTRADING\nLentrading\n\nTRADING INTELLIGENCE\n\nTrading tools for disciplined market decisions, analysis, and execution.\n\nVisit Trading\n\nHOW WE BUILD\n\nHow LenQuant thinks about product.\n\nWe build products where intelligence matters because it fits real work, real context, and real decisions.\n\n01\nWe build around decision-heavy work\n\nLenQuant focuses on environments where context matters, timing matters, and better tools can change outcomes.\n\n02\nWe launch products, not disconnected experiments\n\nThe portfolio spans growth and trading, and the shared standard is practical value.\n\n03\nWe partner selectively\n\nLenQuant is not an agency-for-hire. We work with a small number of founders, partners, and investors when the fit is clear.\n\nPRINCIPLES\n\nA shared way of building across the portfolio.\n\nThe products are not in one category. They belong together because they solve work in a similar way.\n\nContext over prompts\n\nWe build products that start from live operating context instead of making users restate everything from scratch.\n\nIntelligence inside workflows\n\nUseful intelligence belongs where decisions happen: inside research, execution, meetings, and operating loops.\n\nTools that improve with use\n\nThe best systems compound as they learn from behavior, history, conversations, and repeated use.\n\nDesign for real work\n\nWe care about speed, clarity, and judgment in environments where friction quietly slows good work.\n\nBuild focused, not bloated\n\nEach product should do a narrow job exceptionally well before it expands into adjacent territory.\n\nProducts with a clear point of view\n\nWe prefer tools that feel opinionated, legible, and sharp over generic software that tries to be everything at once.\n\nBUILD WITH US\n\nOpen to a small number of the right conversations.\n\nLenQuant builds its own products and occasionally partners on work that fits the same standard.\n\nAUDIENCE\nFor product visitors\n\nSee the portfolio quickly and head straight to the right product.\n\nFor investors\n\nUnderstand the company, the portfolio, and the long-term direction behind it.\n\nFor strategic partners\n\nExplore selective opportunities for collaboration on products and new ventures.\n\nFor talent\n\nGet a feel for the standard of work, product taste, and culture behind LenQuant.\n\nPartner With LenQuant\nInvestor Inquiries\n\nCOMPANY\n\nA product company with the range to build, partner, and launch selectively.\nLenQuant builds its own products and stays open to a small number of aligned collaborations.\nProduct-led, technically ambitious, and selective about where it works.\n\nCREDIBILITY\n\nA company built with long-term standards.\n\nThis site explains the company, but the clearest proof is still the work itself.\n\nOPEN EACH CHAPTER TO SEE HOW THE COMPANY THINKS\n\nBUILD\nFocused products over broad platforms\n\n- We build focused tools where product quality and clarity matter more than breadth.\nLenQuant looks for categories where software can sharpen judgment, reduce drag, and become part of the work itself. We would rather ship a clear product with a strong point of view than stretch into a vague platform story.\n\nOPERATE\nExecution is where products prove themselves\n\n- Products need to hold up in real workflows, repeated use, and everyday pressure.\nOur standard is simple: the product has to hold up when timing matters. That means fewer abstractions, better defaults, and tools that stay useful under pressure instead of only looking good in a concept deck.\n\nEXPAND\nMore products can grow from the same company view\n\n- The current portfolio is a foundation for future products and selective new initiatives.\nGrowth and trading are the early proof points. Over time, the company can extend the same standard into new products where context, speed, and execution quality matter.\n\nNEXT\n\nChoose where to go next.\n\nGo to a product, learn more about the company, or start a conversation.\n\nGo to LenGrowth\n\nTools for acquisition, experimentation, and growth execution.\n\nVisit LenGrowth\nGo to Trading\n\nDecision support and market context for disciplined trading execution.\n\nVisit Trading\nTalk to LenQuant\n\nFor partnerships, investor conversations, media, and talent outreach.\n\nContact LenQuant\n\nLENQUANT\n\nAn applied intelligence company building focused products and pursuing a small number of new ventures.\n\nProducts\nLengrowth\nLentrading\nCompany\nLab\nAbout\nContact\nBuild With Us\nPartnerships\nInvestors\nTalent\n(c) 2026 LenQuant. All rights reserved.\nhello@lenquant.com","depth":1,"ctaCount":3,"confidence":95,"citations":[{"pageUrl":"https://lenquant.com/","evidenceType":"title","label":"Page title","excerpt":"LenQuant | Applied Intelligence Lab","confidence":86},{"pageUrl":"https://lenquant.com/","evidenceType":"meta","label":"Meta description","excerpt":"LenQuant builds focused products across growth and trading.","confidence":80},{"pageUrl":"https://lenquant.com/","evidenceType":"heading","label":"Primary heading","excerpt":"Applied intelligence for change.","confidence":76},{"pageUrl":"https://lenquant.com/","evidenceType":"cta","label":"CTA text","excerpt":"Contact","confidence":78},{"pageUrl":"https://lenquant.com/","evidenceType":"section","label":"Section 1","excerpt":"LenQuant Applied Intelligence Lab Open navigation menu Home Products Lab About Contact Work With LenQuant","confidence":63},{"pageUrl":"https://lenquant.com/","evidenceType":"section","label":"Applied intelligence for change.","excerpt":"Applied intelligence for change. LenQuant builds focused products for several areas of work. The aim is simple: better tools, clearer judgment, and less friction in the work that matters. Product company Applied AI lab S","confidence":65},{"pageUrl":"https://lenquant.com/","evidenceType":"section","label":"Lengrowth","excerpt":"Growth Lengrowth Growth Systems Systems for acquisition, experimentation, and marketing execution. Visit LenGrowth","confidence":57},{"pageUrl":"https://lenquant.com/","evidenceType":"section","label":"Lentrading","excerpt":"Trading Lentrading Trading Intelligence Trading tools for disciplined market decisions, analysis, and execution. Visit Trading","confidence":58},{"pageUrl":"https://lenquant.com/","evidenceType":"section","label":"Focused products that show the approach.","excerpt":"Portfolio Focused products that show the approach. Two focused products, each built to make complex work clearer and easier to execute.","confidence":58}],"errors":[],"rawHtml":"<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><meta charSet=\"utf-8\"/><title>LenQuant | Applied Intelligence Lab</title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"LenQuant builds focused products across growth and trading.\"/><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"/><meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#0b1020\"/><meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\"/><meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"LenQuant\"/><meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"LenQuant | Applied Intelligence Lab\"/><meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"LenQuant builds focused products across growth and trading.\"/><meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://lenquant.com/\"/><meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://lenquant.com/og-image.png\"/><meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1200\"/><meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"630\"/><meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\"/><meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"LenQuant | Applied Intelligence Lab\"/><meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"LenQuant builds focused products across growth and trading.\"/><meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://lenquant.com/og-image.png\"/><link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://lenquant.com/\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon/favicon.ico\" sizes=\"any\"/><link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/png\" sizes=\"32x32\" href=\"/favicon/favicon-32x32.png\"/><link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/png\" sizes=\"16x16\" href=\"/favicon/favicon-16x16.png\"/><link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" sizes=\"180x180\" href=\"/favicon/apple-icon-180x180.png\"/><link rel=\"manifest\" href=\"/favicon/manifest.json\"/><meta name=\"msapplication-config\" content=\"/favicon/browserconfig.xml\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/logo-white-small.png\" as=\"image\" fetchpriority=\"high\"/><meta name=\"next-head-count\" content=\"25\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/css/d57bc1a9428b1387.css\" as=\"style\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/css/d57bc1a9428b1387.css\" data-n-g=\"\"/><noscript data-n-css=\"\"></noscript><script defer=\"\" nomodule=\"\" src=\"/_next/static/chunks/polyfills-42372ed130431b0a.js\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/webpack-ee7e63bc15b31913.js\" defer=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/framework-64ad27b21261a9ce.js\" defer=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/main-a17457fb3543ec0e.js\" defer=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/pages/_app-83d52f687c0a529b.js\" defer=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/2d36dd80-ccdf60ce38cf03f4.js\" defer=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/fb7d5399-edf452b5fa02f884.js\" defer=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/247-78593f5658567af3.js\" defer=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/813-68bed8ce9ef69aca.js\" defer=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/pages/index-54d1dceb1a41b1f5.js\" defer=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/24DXxffZUpWRzhgE6YXpy/_buildManifest.js\" defer=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/24DXxffZUpWRzhgE6YXpy/_ssgManifest.js\" defer=\"\"></script></head><body><div id=\"__next\"><div class=\"site-shell site-shell-home\"><div class=\"page-glow page-glow-top-right\"></div><div class=\"page-glow page-glow-bottom-left\"></div><header class=\"site-header\"><div class=\"container site-header-inner\"><a class=\"brand\" href=\"/\"><span class=\"brand-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><img alt=\"\" fetchpriority=\"high\" width=\"180\" height=\"28\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"brand-logo\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/logo-white-small.png\"/></span><span class=\"brand-copy\"><strong>LenQuant</strong><span>Applied Intelligence Lab</span></span></a><button type=\"button\" class=\"site-menu-toggle\" aria-label=\"Open navigation menu\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"portal-mobile-menu\"><span class=\"site-menu-toggle-label\">Open navigation menu</span><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 7h16M4 12h16M4 17h16\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"></path></svg></button><nav class=\"site-nav\" aria-label=\"Primary navigation\"><a class=\"is-active\" href=\"/\">Home</a><a href=\"/products\">Products</a><a href=\"/lab\">Lab</a><a href=\"/about\">About</a><a href=\"/contact\">Contact</a></nav><div class=\"site-header-cta\"><a class=\"button button-secondary\" style=\"--coord-x:0;--coord-y:0\" href=\"/contact\"><span class=\"button-inner\"><span class=\"button-label\">Work With LenQuant</span><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M16.5 19a4.5 4.5 0 0 0-9 0M12 12a3 3 0 1 0 0-6 3 3 0 0 0 0 6zm6.5 7a3.5 3.5 0 0 0-3.2-3.5M17 11a2.5 2.5 0 1 0 0-5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"></path></svg></span></a></div></div><div class=\"container site-mobile-menu\"><div id=\"portal-mobile-menu\" class=\"site-mobile-menu-panel\"><nav class=\"site-mobile-nav\" aria-label=\"Mobile navigation\"><a class=\"is-active\" href=\"/\">Home</a><a href=\"/products\">Products</a><a href=\"/lab\">Lab</a><a href=\"/about\">About</a><a href=\"/contact\">Contact</a></nav><div class=\"site-mobile-menu-cta\"><a class=\"button button-secondary\" style=\"--coord-x:0;--coord-y:0\" href=\"/contact\"><span class=\"button-inner\"><span class=\"button-label\">Work With LenQuant</span><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M16.5 19a4.5 4.5 0 0 0-9 0M12 12a3 3 0 1 0 0-6 3 3 0 0 0 0 6zm6.5 7a3.5 3.5 0 0 0-3.2-3.5M17 11a2.5 2.5 0 1 0 0-5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"></path></svg></span></a></div></div></div></header><main><section class=\"hero\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"hero-panel hero-panel-home\"><div class=\"hero-visual hero-visual-home\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"hero-wave-shell hero-wave-home\" style=\"--wave-hue:150;--wave-secondary-hue:32\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"hero-grid hero-grid-home\"><div class=\"hero-copy\"><h1>Applied intelligence for change.</h1><p>LenQuant builds focused products for several areas of work. The aim is simple: better tools, clearer judgment, and less friction in the work that matters.</p><div class=\"hero-summary\"><span><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 4l8 4-8 4-8-4 8-4zm-8 8l8 4 8-4M4 16l8 4 8-4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"></path></svg>Product company</span><span><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 3l1.7 5.3L19 10l-5.3 1.7L12 17l-1.7-5.3L5 10l5.3-1.7L12 3zm6 12l.8 2.2L21 18l-2.2.8L18 21l-.8-2.2L15 18l2.2-.8L18 15zM6 14l.8 2.2L9 17l-2.2.8L6 20l-.8-2.2L3 17l2.2-.8L6 14z\" fill=\"currentColor\"></path></svg>Applied AI lab</span><span><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 6a2 2 0 1 0 0 4 2 2 0 0 0 0-4zm0 8a2 2 0 1 0 0 4 2 2 0 0 0 0-4zm10-4a2 2 0 1 0 0 4 2 2 0 0 0 0-4zM9 8h4a4 4 0 0 1 4 4m-8 4h4a4 4 0 0 0 4-4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"></path></svg>Selective partner</span></div><div class=\"hero-actions\"><a class=\"button button-primary\" style=\"--coord-x:0;--coord-y:0\" href=\"/products\"><span class=\"button-inner\"><span class=\"button-label\">Explore Products</span><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M13 5l7 7-7 7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"></path></svg></span></a><a class=\"button button-secondary\" style=\"--coord-x:0;--coord-y:0\" href=\"/contact\"><span class=\"button-inner\"><span class=\"button-label\">Work With LenQuant</span><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M16.5 19a4.5 4.5 0 0 0-9 0M12 12a3 3 0 1 0 0-6 3 3 0 0 0 0 6zm6.5 7a3.5 3.5 0 0 0-3.2-3.5M17 11a2.5 2.5 0 1 0 0-5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"></path></svg></span></a></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"section-header section-header-with-lead\"><div class=\"section-header-lead\"><div class=\"section-accent-icon section-accent-icon-portfolio\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"section-header-copy\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Portfolio</p><h2>Focused products that show the approach.</h2><p class=\"section-description\">Two focused products, each built to make complex work clearer and easier to execute.</p></div></div><div class=\"product-spotlight-grid\"><article class=\"product-spotlight tone-emerald\"><span class=\"product-spotlight-icon\"><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 19h16M7 15l3-3 3 2 4-5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"></path><circle cx=\"7\" cy=\"15\" r=\"1.1\" fill=\"currentColor\"></circle><circle cx=\"10\" cy=\"12\" r=\"1.1\" fill=\"currentColor\"></circle><circle cx=\"13\" cy=\"14\" r=\"1.1\" fill=\"currentColor\"></circle><circle cx=\"17\" cy=\"9\" r=\"1.1\" fill=\"currentColor\"></circle></svg></span><div class=\"product-spotlight-copy\"><span class=\"badge\">Growth</span><h3>Lengrowth</h3><p class=\"product-spotlight-kicker\">Growth Systems</p><p>Systems for acquisition, experimentation, and marketing execution.</p></div><a class=\"button button-primary\" href=\"https://growth.lenquant.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" style=\"--coord-x:0;--coord-y:0\"><span class=\"button-inner\"><span class=\"button-label\">Visit LenGrowth</span><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M13 5l7 7-7 7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"></path></svg></span></a></article><article class=\"product-spotlight tone-amber\"><span class=\"product-spotlight-icon\"><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 12h4l2.2-5 3.6 10 2.5-5H21\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"></path></svg></span><div class=\"product-spotlight-copy\"><span class=\"badge\">Trading</span><h3>Lentrading</h3><p class=\"product-spotlight-kicker\">Trading Intelligence</p><p>Trading tools for disciplined market decisions, analysis, and execution.</p></div><a class=\"button button-primary\" href=\"https://trading.lenquant.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" style=\"--coord-x:0;--coord-y:0\"><span class=\"button-inner\"><span class=\"button-label\">Visit Trading</span><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M13 5l7 7-7 7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"></path></svg></span></a></article></div></div></section><section class=\"section\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"section-header section-header-with-lead\"><div class=\"section-header-lead\"><div class=\"section-accent-icon section-accent-icon-pie\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"section-header-copy\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">How We Build</p><h2>How LenQuant thinks about product.</h2><p class=\"section-description\">We build products where intelligence matters because it fits real work, real context, and real decisions.</p></div></div><div class=\"thesis-flow\"><article class=\"card flow-card tone-emerald\" style=\"--pointer-x:50%;--pointer-y:50%\"><span class=\"flow-index\">0<!-- -->1</span><div class=\"feature-card-top\"><h3>We build around decision-heavy work</h3><span class=\"card-icon subtle\"><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 12h4l2.2-5 3.6 10 2.5-5H21\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"></path></svg></span></div><p>LenQuant focuses on environments where context matters, timing matters, and better tools can change outcomes.</p></article><article class=\"card flow-card tone-amber\" style=\"--pointer-x:50%;--pointer-y:50%\"><span class=\"flow-index\">0<!-- -->2</span><div class=\"feature-card-top\"><h3>We launch products, not disconnected experiments</h3><span class=\"card-icon subtle\"><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 4l8 4-8 4-8-4 8-4zm-8 8l8 4 8-4M4 16l8 4 8-4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"></path></svg></span></div><p>The portfolio spans growth and trading, and the shared standard is practical value.</p></article><article class=\"card flow-card tone-rose\" style=\"--pointer-x:50%;--pointer-y:50%\"><span class=\"flow-index\">0<!-- -->3</span><div class=\"feature-card-top\"><h3>We partner selectively</h3><span class=\"card-icon subtle\"><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 6a2 2 0 1 0 0 4 2 2 0 0 0 0-4zm0 8a2 2 0 1 0 0 4 2 2 0 0 0 0-4zm10-4a2 2 0 1 0 0 4 2 2 0 0 0 0-4zM9 8h4a4 4 0 0 1 4 4m-8 4h4a4 4 0 0 0 4-4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"></path></svg></span></div><p>LenQuant is not an agency-for-hire. We work with a small number of founders, partners, and investors when the fit is clear.</p></article></div></div></section><section class=\"section\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"section-header section-header-with-lead\"><div class=\"section-header-lead\"><div class=\"section-accent-icon section-accent-icon-pulse\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"section-header-copy\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Principles</p><h2>A shared way of building across the portfolio.</h2><p class=\"section-description\">The products are not in one category. They belong together because they solve work in a similar way.</p></div></div><div class=\"grid-3\"><article class=\"card principle-card tone-emerald\" style=\"--pointer-x:50%;--pointer-y:50%\"><span class=\"card-icon principle-icon\"><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 4l8 4-8 4-8-4 8-4zm-8 8l8 4 8-4M4 16l8 4 8-4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"></path></svg></span><h3>Context over prompts</h3><p>We build products that start from live operating context instead of making users restate everything from scratch.</p></article><article class=\"card principle-card tone-amber\" style=\"--pointer-x:50%;--pointer-y:50%\"><span class=\"card-icon principle-icon\"><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 12h4l2.2-5 3.6 10 2.5-5H21\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"></path></svg></span><h3>Intelligence inside workflows</h3><p>Useful intelligence belongs where decisions happen: inside research, execution, meetings, and operating loops.</p></article><article class=\"card principle-card tone-rose\" style=\"--pointer-x:50%;--pointer-y:50%\"><span class=\"card-icon principle-icon\"><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M8 4H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v2m12-4h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v2M8 20H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-2m12 4h2a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-2M7 12h10\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"></path></svg></span><h3>Tools that improve with use</h3><p>The best systems compound as they learn from behavior, history, conversations, and repeated use.</p></article><article class=\"card principle-card tone-emerald\" style=\"--pointer-x:50%;--pointer-y:50%\"><span class=\"card-icon principle-icon\"><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 3l7 3v5c0 4.5-2.7 7.9-7 10-4.3-2.1-7-5.5-7-10V6l7-3z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"></path></svg></span><h3>Design for real work</h3><p>We care about speed, clarity, and judgment in environments where friction quietly slows good work.</p></article><article class=\"card principle-card tone-amber\" style=\"--pointer-x:50%;--pointer-y:50%\"><span class=\"card-icon principle-icon\"><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 6a2 2 0 1 0 0 4 2 2 0 0 0 0-4zm0 8a2 2 0 1 0 0 4 2 2 0 0 0 0-4zm10-4a2 2 0 1 0 0 4 2 2 0 0 0 0-4zM9 8h4a4 4 0 0 1 4 4m-8 4h4a4 4 0 0 0 4-4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"></path></svg></span><h3>Build focused, not bloated</h3><p>Each product should do a narrow job exceptionally well before it expands into adjacent territory.</p></article><article class=\"card principle-card tone-rose\" style=\"--pointer-x:50%;--pointer-y:50%\"><span class=\"card-icon principle-icon\"><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 3l1.7 5.3L19 10l-5.3 1.7L12 17l-1.7-5.3L5 10l5.3-1.7L12 3zm6 12l.8 2.2L21 18l-2.2.8L18 21l-.8-2.2L15 18l2.2-.8L18 15zM6 14l.8 2.2L9 17l-2.2.8L6 20l-.8-2.2L3 17l2.2-.8L6 14z\" fill=\"currentColor\"></path></svg></span><h3>Products with a clear point of view</h3><p>We prefer tools that feel opinionated, legible, and sharp over generic software that tries to be everything at once.</p></article></div></div></section><section class=\"section\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"section-header section-header-with-lead\"><div class=\"section-header-lead\"><div class=\"section-accent-icon section-accent-icon-balance\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"section-header-copy\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Build With Us</p><h2>Open to a small number of the right conversations.</h2><p class=\"section-description\">LenQuant builds its own products and occasionally partners on work that fits the same standard.</p></div></div><div class=\"partner-grid\"><article class=\"card cta-panel tone-emerald\" style=\"--pointer-x:50%;--pointer-y:50%\"><span class=\"badge\"><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M16.5 19a4.5 4.5 0 0 0-9 0M12 12a3 3 0 1 0 0-6 3 3 0 0 0 0 6zm6.5 7a3.5 3.5 0 0 0-3.2-3.5M17 11a2.5 2.5 0 1 0 0-5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"></path></svg>Audience</span><div class=\"grid-2 audience-grid\"><div class=\"audience-item\"><h3>For product visitors</h3><p>See the portfolio quickly and head straight to the right product.</p></div><div class=\"audience-item\"><h3>For investors</h3><p>Understand the company, the portfolio, and the long-term direction behind it.</p></div><div class=\"audience-item\"><h3>For strategic partners</h3><p>Explore selective opportunities for collaboration on products and new ventures.</p></div><div class=\"audience-item\"><h3>For talent</h3><p>Get a feel for the standard of work, product taste, and culture behind LenQuant.</p></div></div><div class=\"cta-row section-actions\"><a class=\"button button-primary\" style=\"--coord-x:0;--coord-y:0\" href=\"/contact\"><span class=\"button-inner\"><span class=\"button-label\">Partner With LenQuant</span><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M13 5l7 7-7 7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"></path></svg></span></a><a class=\"button button-secondary\" style=\"--coord-x:0;--coord-y:0\" href=\"mailto:hello@lenquant.com?subject=Investor%20Inquiry\"><span class=\"button-inner\"><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 7h16v10H4zM4 8l8 6 8-6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"></path></svg><span class=\"button-label\">Investor Inquiries</span></span></a></div></article><article class=\"card quote-card tone-rose\" style=\"--pointer-x:50%;--pointer-y:50%\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Company</p><h3>A product company with the range to build, partner, and launch selectively.</h3><blockquote>LenQuant builds its own products and stays open to a small number of aligned collaborations.</blockquote><footer>Product-led, technically ambitious, and selective about where it works.</footer></article></div></div></section><section class=\"section\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"section-header section-header-with-lead\"><div class=\"section-header-lead\"><div class=\"section-accent-icon section-accent-icon-cradle\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"section-header-copy\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Credibility</p><h2>A company built with long-term standards.</h2><p class=\"section-description\">This site explains the company, but the clearest proof is still the work itself.</p></div></div><div class=\"credibility-accordion\"><div class=\"credibility-tabs\"><p class=\"credibility-tabs-label\">Open each chapter to see how the company thinks</p><div class=\"timeline-trigger tone-emerald is-active\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"accordion-trigger is-active\" aria-expanded=\"true\"><span class=\"timeline-marker\">Build</span><div class=\"timeline-title\"><span class=\"card-icon subtle\"><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 4l8 4-8 4-8-4 8-4zm-8 8l8 4 8-4M4 16l8 4 8-4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"></path></svg></span><h3>Focused products over broad platforms</h3></div></button><div class=\"accordion-panel is-open\"><p><strong>- <!-- -->We build focused tools where product quality and clarity matter more than breadth.</strong><br/>LenQuant looks for categories where software can sharpen judgment, reduce drag, and become part of the work itself. We would rather ship a clear product with a strong point of view than stretch into a vague platform story.</p></div></div><div class=\"timeline-trigger tone-amber \"><button type=\"button\" class=\"accordion-trigger \" aria-expanded=\"false\"><span class=\"timeline-marker\">Operate</span><div class=\"timeline-title\"><span class=\"card-icon subtle\"><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 12h4l2.2-5 3.6 10 2.5-5H21\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"></path></svg></span><h3>Execution is where products prove themselves</h3></div></button><div class=\"accordion-panel \"><p><strong>- <!-- -->Products need to hold up in real workflows, repeated use, and everyday pressure.</strong><br/>Our standard is simple: the product has to hold up when timing matters. That means fewer abstractions, better defaults, and tools that stay useful under pressure instead of only looking good in a concept deck.</p></div></div><div class=\"timeline-trigger tone-rose \"><button type=\"button\" class=\"accordion-trigger \" aria-expanded=\"false\"><span class=\"timeline-marker\">Expand</span><div class=\"timeline-title\"><span class=\"card-icon subtle\"><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 6a2 2 0 1 0 0 4 2 2 0 0 0 0-4zm0 8a2 2 0 1 0 0 4 2 2 0 0 0 0-4zm10-4a2 2 0 1 0 0 4 2 2 0 0 0 0-4zM9 8h4a4 4 0 0 1 4 4m-8 4h4a4 4 0 0 0 4-4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"></path></svg></span><h3>More products can grow from the same company view</h3></div></button><div class=\"accordion-panel \"><p><strong>- <!-- -->The current portfolio is a foundation for future products and selective new initiatives.</strong><br/>Growth and trading are the early proof points. Over time, the company can extend the same standard into new products where context, speed, and execution quality matter.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"section-header section-header-with-lead\"><div class=\"section-header-lead\"><div class=\"section-accent-icon section-accent-icon-arrows\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div></div><div class=\"section-header-copy\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Next</p><h2>Choose where to go next.</h2><p class=\"section-description\">Go to a product, learn more about the company, or start a conversation.</p></div></div><div class=\"next-grid\"><div class=\"next-link tone-emerald\"><span class=\"product-spotlight-icon\"><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 19h16M7 15l3-3 3 2 4-5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"></path><circle cx=\"7\" cy=\"15\" r=\"1.1\" fill=\"currentColor\"></circle><circle cx=\"10\" cy=\"12\" r=\"1.1\" fill=\"currentColor\"></circle><circle cx=\"13\" cy=\"14\" r=\"1.1\" fill=\"currentColor\"></circle><circle cx=\"17\" cy=\"9\" r=\"1.1\" fill=\"currentColor\"></circle></svg></span><h3>Go to LenGrowth</h3><p>Tools for acquisition, experimentation, and growth execution.</p><a class=\"button button-primary\" href=\"https://growth.lenquant.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" style=\"--coord-x:0;--coord-y:0\"><span class=\"button-inner\"><span class=\"button-label\">Visit LenGrowth</span><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M13 5l7 7-7 7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"></path></svg></span></a></div><div class=\"next-link tone-amber\"><span class=\"product-spotlight-icon\"><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 12h4l2.2-5 3.6 10 2.5-5H21\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"></path></svg></span><h3>Go to Trading</h3><p>Decision support and market context for disciplined trading execution.</p><a class=\"button button-primary\" href=\"https://trading.lenquant.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" style=\"--coord-x:0;--coord-y:0\"><span class=\"button-inner\"><span class=\"button-label\">Visit Trading</span><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M13 5l7 7-7 7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"></path></svg></span></a></div><div class=\"next-link tone-emerald\"><span class=\"product-spotlight-icon\"><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 7h16v10H4zM4 8l8 6 8-6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"></path></svg></span><h3>Talk to LenQuant</h3><p>For partnerships, investor conversations, media, and talent outreach.</p><a class=\"button button-secondary\" style=\"--coord-x:0;--coord-y:0\" href=\"/contact\"><span class=\"button-inner\"><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 7h16v10H4zM4 8l8 6 8-6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"></path></svg><span class=\"button-label\">Contact LenQuant</span></span></a></div></div></div></section><div class=\"separator\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div></main><footer class=\"site-footer\"><div class=\"container site-footer-grid\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">LenQuant</p><p class=\"footer-blurb\">An applied intelligence company building focused products and pursuing a small number of new ventures.</p></div><div><h3>Products</h3><ul class=\"footer-list\"><li><a href=\"https://growth.lenquant.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Lengrowth</a></li><li><a href=\"https://trading.lenquant.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Lentrading</a></li></ul></div><div><h3>Company</h3><ul class=\"footer-list\"><li><a href=\"/lab\">Lab</a></li><li><a href=\"/about\">About</a></li><li><a href=\"/contact\">Contact</a></li></ul></div><div><h3>Build With Us</h3><ul class=\"footer-list\"><li><a href=\"mailto:hello@lenquant.com?subject=Partnership%20Inquiry\">Partnerships</a></li><li><a href=\"mailto:hello@lenquant.com?subject=Investor%20Inquiry\">Investors</a></li><li><a href=\"mailto:hello@lenquant.com?subject=Talent%