e right place.\n\nUse this page for product questions, partnerships, investor outreach, media, or talent conversations with LenQuant.\n\nINQUIRY TYPES\n\nWhat should your message be about?\n\nA short note with a bit of context is enough to get the conversation started.\n\nProduct questions\n\nQuestions about LenGrowth or LenTrading and where each product fits.\n\nPartnerships\n\nSelective collaboration, co-building, or work around a new product idea.\n\nInvestor inquiries\n\nConversations about the company, current products, and future direction.\n\nPress and media\n\nCompany background, product context, and requests related to LenQuant coverage.\n\nCareers and talent\n\nReach out if you want to work on thoughtful products with a builder-led team.\n\nSTART HERE\n\nSend a note.\n\nUse the form for product questions, partnerships, investor outreach, media, or talent conversations.\n\nEMAIL\n\nDirect email\n\nYou can also email the team directly at hello@lenquant.com.\n\nEmail LenQuant\nPartnership Inquiry\nName\nEmail\nCompany or title\nWhat are you reaching out about?\nSend\n\nLENQUANT\n\nAn applied intelligence company building focused products and pursuing a small number of new ventures.\n\nProducts\nLengrowth\nLentrading\nCompany\nLab\nAbout\nContact\nBuild With Us\nPartnerships\nInvestors\nTalent\n(c) 2026 LenQuant. All rights reserved.\nhello@lenquant.com","depth":1,"ctaCount":3,"confidence":95,"citations":[{"pageUrl":"https://lenquant.com/contact","evidenceType":"title","label":"Page title","excerpt":"Contact | LenQuant","confidence":86},{"pageUrl":"https://lenquant.com/contact","evidenceType":"meta","label":"Meta description","excerpt":"Contact LenQuant for product questions, partnerships, investor inquiries, media, and careers.","confidence":80},{"pageUrl":"https://lenquant.com/contact","evidenceType":"heading","label":"Primary heading","excerpt":"Route the conversation to the right place.","confidence":76},{"pageUrl":"https://lenquant.com/contact","evidenceT