t focuses on environments where context matters, timing matters, and better tools can change outcomes.","html":"<article class=\"card feature-card tone-emerald\" style=\"--pointer-x:50%;--pointer-y:50%\"><span class=\"badge\"><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 12h4l2.2-5 3.6 10 2.5-5H21\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"></path></svg>Focus</span><h3>We build around decision-heavy work</h3><p>LenQuant focuses on environments where context matters, timing matters, and better tools can change outcomes.</p></article>","ctas":[],"imageUrls":[],"assetUrls":[],"improvementNotes":[],"confidence":58,"screenshotUrl":"C:\\tmp\\lenquant_assets\\visual-captures\\LenQuant\\crawl-bfa05eaf2df646c9a39d8131a14e427a\\05-lab-section-03.png","boundingBox":{"x":130.0,"y":820.296875,"width":380.0,"height":212.953125},"computedStyles":{"backgroundColor":"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)","color":"rgb(250, 250, 250)","fontFamily":"\"Plus Jakarta Sans\", sans-serif","padding":"23.2px","margin":"0px","fontSize":"16px"}},{"id":"section-4","index":4,"type":"unknown","tagName":"article","selector":"article.card.feature-card.tone-rose","heading":"We partner selectively","text":"SHIP\nWe launch products, not disconnected experiments\n\nThe portfolio spans growth and trading, and the shared standard is practical value.","html":"<article class=\"card feature-card tone-amber\" style=\"--pointer-x:50%;--pointer-y:50%\"><span class=\"badge\"><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 4l8 4-8 4-8-4 8-4zm-8 8l8 4 8-4M4 16l8 4 8-4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"></path></svg>Ship</span><h3>We launch products, not disconnected experiments</h3><p>The portfolio spans growth and trading, and the shared standard is practical value.</p></article>","ctas":[],"imageUrls":[],"assetUrls":[],"improvementNotes":[],"confidence":59,"screenshotUrl":"C:\\tmp\\lenquant_assets\\visual-captures\\LenQuant\\crawl-bfa05eaf2df646c9a39d8131a14e427a\\05-lab-section-04.png","boundingBox":{"x":530.0,"y":820.296875,"width":380.0,"height":212.953125},"computedStyles":{"backgroundColor":"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)","color":"rgb(250, 250, 250)","fontFamily":"\"Plus Jakarta Sans\", sans-serif","padding":"23.2px","margin":"0px","fontSize":"16px"}},{"id":"section-5","index":5,"type":"unknown","tagName":"section","selector":"section.section","heading":"How LenQuant builds.","text":"PARTNER\nWe partner selectively\n\nLenQuant is not an agency-for-hire. We work with a small number of founders, partners, and investors when the fit is clear.","html":"<article class=\"card feature-card tone-rose\" style=\"--pointer-x:50%;--pointer-y:50%\"><span class=\"badge\"><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 6a2 2 0 1 0 0 4 2 2 0 0 0 0-4zm0 8a2 2 0 1 0 0 4 2 2 0 0 0 0-4zm10-4a2 2 0 1 0 0 4 2 2 0 0 0 0-4zM9 8h4a4 4 0 0 1 4 4m-8 4h4a4 4 0 0 0 4-4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"></path></svg>Partner</span><h3>We partner selectively</h3><p>LenQuant is not an agency-for-hire. We work with a small number of founders, partners, and investors when the fit is clear.</p></article>","ctas":[],"imageUrls":[],"assetUrls":[],"improvementNotes":[],"confidence":59,"screenshotUrl":"C:\\tmp\\lenquant_assets\\visual-captures\\LenQuant\\crawl-bfa05eaf2df646c9a39d8131a14e427a\\05-lab-section-05.png","boundingBox":{"x":930.0,"y":820.296875,"width":380.0,"height":212.953125},"computedStyles":{"backgroundColor":"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)","color":"rgb(250, 250, 250)","fontFamily":"\"Plus Jakarta Sans\", sans-serif","padding":"23.2px","margin":"0px","fontSize":"16px"}},{"id":"section-6","index":6,"type":"unknown","tagName":"article","selector":"article.card.principle-card.tone-emerald","heading":"Context over prompts","text":"OPERATING PRINCIPLES\n\nWhat makes a LenQuant product feel distinct.\n\nWe use a small set of principles to keep products focused, credible, and useful.\n\nContext over prompts\n\nWe build products that start from live operating context instead of making users restate everything from scratch.\n\nIntelligence inside workflows\n\nUseful intelligence belongs where decisions happen: inside research, execution, meetings, and operating loops.\n\nTools that improve with use\n\nThe best systems compound as they learn from behavior, history, conversations, and repeated use.\n\nDesign for real work\n\nWe care about speed, clarity, and judgment in environments where friction quietly slows good work.\n\nBuild focused, not bloated\n\nEach product should do a narrow job exceptionally well before it expands into adjacent territory.","html":"<section class=\"section\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"section-header section-header-with-lead\"><div class=\"section-header-lead\"><div class=\"section-accent-icon section-accent-icon-pulse\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><canvas data-engine=\"three.js r183\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" style=\"display: block;\"></canvas></div></div><div class=\"section-header-copy\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Operating Principles</p><h2>What makes a LenQuant product feel distinct.</h2><p class=\"section-description\">We use a small set of principles to keep products focused, credible, and useful.</p></div></div><div class=\"grid-3\"><article class=\"card principle-card tone-emerald\" style=\"--pointer-x:50%;--pointer-y:50%\"><span class=\"card-icon principle-icon\"><svg class=\"icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 3l7 3v5c0 4.5-2.7 7.9-7 10-4.3-2.1-7-5.5-7-10V6l7-3z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"></path></svg></span><h3>Context over prompts</h3><p>We build products that start from live operating context instead of making users restate everything from scratch.</p